{"id":"retro-y2k","title":"Retro / Y2K — Nostalgia Page","description":"A loving parody of the 2000s personal web — fake browser window, starfield background, rainbow WordArt title, marquee, visitor counter and blinking badges. For creative brands and fun side projects.","tags":["retro","y2k","nostalgia"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T18:28:52.806Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Retro / Y2K — Nostalgia Page\ndescription: A loving parody of the 2000s personal web — fake browser window, starfield background, rainbow WordArt title, marquee, visitor counter and blinking badges. For creative brands and fun side projects.\ntags: [retro, y2k, nostalgia]\norder: 9\n---\n\n# Retro / Y2K — Nostalgia Page\n\nThe hand-made web of 2002, recreated with modern CSS: window chrome with beveled borders, tiled starfield, rainbow gradient WordArt, scrolling marquee, hit counter and a \"best viewed\" badge.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Desktop | `#008080` teal (classic wallpaper) |\n| Window | `#c0c0c0` silver with outset bevels, navy `#000080` title bar |\n| Page inside | `#000033` starfield |\n| Accents | `#00ff00` lime, `#ffff00` yellow, `#ff00ff` magenta |\n| Type | \"Comic Sans MS\", Verdana, Times New Roman |\n\n## Pieces\n\nFake browser frame → rainbow welcome → marquee → table layout with \"about me\" + guestbook → hit counter (persists in localStorage) → webring + best-viewed badges.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Retro / Y2K — Nostalgia Page\n\nThe hand-made web of 2002, recreated with modern CSS: window chrome with beveled borders, tiled starfield, rainbow gradient WordArt, scrolling marquee, hit counter and a \"best viewed\" badge.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Desktop | `#008080` teal (classic wallpaper) |\n| Window | `#c0c0c0` silver with outset bevels, navy `#000080` title bar |\n| Page inside | `#000033` starfield |\n| Accents | `#00ff00` lime, `#ffff00` yellow, `#ff00ff` magenta |\n| Type | \"Comic Sans MS\", Verdana, Times New Roman |\n\n## Pieces\n\nFake browser frame → rainbow welcome → marquee → table layout with \"about me\" + guestbook → hit counter (persists in localStorage) → webring + best-viewed badges.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>★ ~ WeLcOmE 2 My WeBsItE ~ ★\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; background: #008080; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; padding: 26px 14px; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: flex-start; }\n\n  /* fake browser window */\n  .window { width: 100%; max-width: 760px; background: #c0c0c0; border: 2px outset #fff; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); }\n  .titlebar { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #000080, #1084d0); color: #fff; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 4px 6px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }\n  .titlebar .btns button { width: 18px; height: 16px; margin-left: 2px; background: #c0c0c0; border: 2px outset #fff; font-size: 9px; cursor: pointer; font-family: Tahoma, sans-serif; }\n  .menubar { background: #c0c0c0; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 3px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #808080; }\n  .menubar span { padding: 1px 7px; cursor: default; }\n  .menubar span:hover { background: #000080; color: #fff; }\n  .addr { background: #c0c0c0; font-size: 11px; padding: 3px 8px 6px; display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; border-bottom: 2px inset #fff; }\n  .addr input { flex: 1; border: 2px inset #fff; font-family: \"Courier New\", monospace; font-size: 11.5px; padding: 2px 5px; background: #fff; }\n\n  /* the \"webpage\" inside */\n  .page { background: #000033 url('') ; background-image: radial-gradient(#fff 1px, transparent 1.4px), radial-gradient(#8fa8ff 1px, transparent 1.4px); background-size: 90px 90px, 55px 55px; background-position: 0 0, 27px 31px; padding: 24px 18px; text-align: center; }\n\n  .wordart { font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", \"Comic Sans\", cursive; font-size: clamp(30px, 7vw, 52px); font-weight: bold; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ff00ff, #ffff00, #00ff00, #00ffff);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25); text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #ff00ff44; transform: rotate(-2deg); margin: 6px 0 2px; }\n  .subtitle { color: #ffff00; font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive; font-size: 14px; }\n  .blink { animation: blink 1s steps(1) infinite; }\n  @keyframes blink { 50% { opacity: 0; } }\n\n  .marquee { background: #000; border: 2px ridge #ff00ff; color: #00ff00; font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive; font-size: 13px; overflow: hidden; margin: 16px 0; }\n  .marquee div { white-space: nowrap; display: inline-block; padding: 6px 0; animation: scrollx 14s linear infinite; }\n  @keyframes scrollx { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }\n\n  table.main { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 6px; }\n  table.main td { border: 3px ridge #8fa8ff; padding: 14px; vertical-align: top; background: rgba(0, 0, 128, 0.55); }\n  td.left { width: 42%; }\n  h2 { color: #00ffff; font-family: \"Comic Sans MS\", cursive; font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 8px; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000; }\n  p, li { color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.7; }\n  ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; text-align: left; }\n  li::before { content: \"★ \"; color: #ffff00; }\n  .counter { display: inline-block; background: #000; border: 2px inset #fff; padding: 4px 10px; font-family: \"Courier New\", monospace; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #00ff00; margin: 8px 0; }\n  .label { color: #ff69b4; font-wei